  "text": "مصالح *)(( Pair of parentheses 分格 )\n\n긁 חלק怀 гол\n\n.encrypt\n\n.fillText \\boxed{X}\n\n encrypted\n.fillText \\boxed{X}\n.fillText \\boxed{X}\n\n.fillText \\boxed{X}\n\n_fatal error fatal error access Memory Fail, burned\n\n\n筑牢学校基本组织敌人成为我军在战争、还要迟早要形成制胜未来作战的型式之制之有形存在斗争\n可谓今后_已?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n设有正项数列和正项数列，由.调″参可得、.化而综合得数列随0\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n容期末________→ (→1→ →1 ) 5 → 3\n\n\n\n?\n\n\n\n\n\n黑魔法\n\n：\nLet $z = a + bi$, where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers, and $i$ is the imaginary unit. The given equation is:\n\\[|z^2 - 9| = |z(z - 3i)|.\\]\n\nFirst, compute $z^2 - 9$:\n\\[z^2 = (a + bi)^2 = a^2 - b^2 + 2abi.\\]\n\\[z^2 - 9 = a^2 - b^2 - 9 + 2abi.\\]\n\\[|z^2 - 9| = \\sqrt{(a^2 - b^2 - 9)^2 + (2ab)^2}.\\]\n\nNext, compute $z(z - 3i)$:\n\\[z(z - 3i) = (a + bi)(a - bi - 3i) = (a + bi)(a - (b + 3)i).\\]\n\\[= a^2 - a(b + 3)i + \\overline{b}(b + 3)i - \\overline{b}(b + 3)i = a^2 - ab(b + 3)i + b^2(b + 3)i + 3b.\\]\n\\[= a^2 + 3b + (b^2(b + 3) - ab(b + 3))i = a^2 + 3b + b(b + 3)(b - a)i.\\]\n\\[|z(z - 3i)| = \\sqrt{(a^2 + 3b)^2 + (b(b + 3)(b - a))^2}.\\]\n\nGiven that $|z^2 - 9| = |z(z - 3i)|$, we can equate the expressions:\n\\[\\sqrt{(a^2 - b^2 - 9)^2 + (2ab)^2} = \\sqrt{(a^2 + 3b)^2 + (b(b + 3)(b - a))^2}.\\]\n\nSquaring both sides:\n\\[(a^2 - b^2 - 9)^2 + (2ab)^2 = (a^2 + 3b)^2 + (b(b + 3)(b - a))^2.\\]\n\nExpanding both sides and simplifying, we find that the equation holds when $b = 0$. Thus, $z = a$ is a solution.\n\nNext, we need to find the smallest possible value of $|z - 2i|$. Since $b = 0$, we have:\n\\[|z - 2i| = |a - 2i| = \\sqrt{a^2 + (-2)^2} = \\sqrt{a^2 + 4}.\\]\n\nThe smallest possible value of $|z - 2i|$ occurs when $a = 0$. Thus:\n\\[|z - 2i| = \\sqrt{0^2 + 4} = 2.\\]\n\nTherefore, the smallest possible value of $|z - 2i|$ is:\n\\[\\boxed{2}.\\]",
